<p class="agreement agreement_title">1. Scope of Services</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">The Auto Repair Shop agrees to provide the following services to the Customer:</p>

<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Diagnostic services, including but not limited to: [list of diagnostic services].</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Repair services, including but not limited to: [list of repairs to be performed].</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Replacement of parts as needed, with customer approval.
The shop will provide an estimate of the cost for repairs and parts prior to performing any work, unless the repair is an emergency situation requiring immediate attention.</p>

<p class="agreement agreement_title">2. Estimates & Authorization</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Estimate: An estimate for the repair services will be provided to the customer prior to the commencement of work. This estimate will outline the parts and labor costs.
Authorization: The Customer authorizes the shop to perform necessary repairs or diagnostics as outlined in the estimate. The Customer will sign the authorization form before work begins.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">3. Payment Terms</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Deposit: A non-refundable deposit of [amount]% of the total estimate may be required before work begins.
Balance: The remaining balance will be due upon completion of the repair services, prior to the release of the vehicle.
Payment Methods: Payments can be made via [list payment methods, e.g., cash, credit card, check, etc.].</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">4. Completion and Delivery</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">The Auto Repair Shop will make reasonable efforts to complete the repair services in a timely manner. The estimated completion date is [insert date or timeframe]. However, delays due to parts availability, labor, or other unforeseen circumstances may occur.
The Customer will be notified if the completion date needs to be adjusted.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">5. Warranty</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">The Auto Repair Shop offers a warranty on labor and parts for [insert warranty period, e.g., 90 days, 6 months, etc.]. This warranty covers any defects in parts and workmanship but does not apply to damage caused by improper use, accidents, or neglect.
If the vehicle fails within the warranty period due to the repair, the shop will re-perform the services at no additional labor cost, but the customer may still be responsible for parts replacement.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">6. Customer Responsibilities</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">The Customer agrees to provide the Auto Repair Shop with access to the vehicle, including keys and any necessary information to complete the work.
The Customer is responsible for any vehicle or property left at the repair shop. The shop is not liable for loss or damage unless caused by its own negligence.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">7. Limitation of Liability</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">The Auto Repair Shop will not be held liable for any incidental or consequential damages, including but not limited to loss of use of the vehicle, damages to personal property, or loss of time. The shop’s liability is limited to the cost of the repair services provided.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">8. Termination of Agreement</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">Either party may terminate this Agreement at any time, provided that the Customer has paid for all services rendered up to the termination point.
If the Customer cancels the service after work has begun, they may be responsible for any costs incurred for parts or labor up until that point.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">9. Dispute Resolution</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">In case of any disputes or disagreements, both parties agree to attempt to resolve the matter through mediation before resorting to legal action.</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">10. Governing Law</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">This Agreement shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of [your state or jurisdiction].</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_title">11. Signatures</p>
<p class="agreement agreement_desc">By signing below, both parties acknowledge that they have read, understood, and agree to the terms and conditions outlined in this Auto Repair Service Agreement.</p>
